metallic gold liquid that reflects the light and throws it around. White marble
bricks enclose the pool, cut to fit perfectly together. The pool swirls
into a picture! You see the blurred images of a stone chamber which seems
to be the end of a long hallyway. Above the chamber you can see where a
portal shimmers and glows. A air of danger seems to emanate from the image.
