E
mask defiance paladin~
The legend behind this artifact goes back to a nameless paladin
who traversed the planes to face countless demons in revenge against
the death of his comrades, a ranger, and a thief. So determined was
he that he fought and destroyed until his body would no longer go on.
So strong was his spirit however, that it roamed free until it found
a great sorcerer. The spirit made a pact with this sorcerer and had its
essence bound into a simple mask of steel. The mask is a profile of
the paladin's eyes, forever defiant and unwilling to give up.
~
