Red liquid fills the pool, reflecting light back in a thousand different 
directions.  As you look into the mercury, an image slowly takes form! 
The image in the pool is quite clear, and very freightening.  A huge river 
of totally black water flows along quietly underneath a starless sky.  Bones
and broken skeletons lay scattered along the rivers edge.  Far off the in 
distance on the river, you can make out what appears to be a small boat,
with a lone figure standing atop it.  Moans and tortured cries can be heard
in the through the mist...
